:: Statement-only formalization of Logipedia corpus artifact
:: connectives.match_ex_prop (logipedia__mizar__connectives.match_ex_prop),
:: catalog title "connectives.match_ex_prop": existential elimination derives
:: an arbitrary return proposition from a handler for every witness.
:: This file contains no proof.

environ
begin

::$P-
scheme ConnectivesMatchExProp {
  A() -> set, P[object], SourceReturn[]
} :
  (for x being object st x in A() holds
    P[x] implies SourceReturn[]) implies
  ((ex x being object st x in A() & P[x]) implies SourceReturn[])
proof
end;
::$P+
